# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Bastion is a tool, not a server.
#
#  This working directory is a live Minecraft server: world saves,
#  player data, secrets in server.properties, mod jars nobody may
#  redistribute, and several hundred config files written by the mods
#  themselves. None of it belongs on the remote, and none of it is
#  what makes this repository useful -- you bring your own mods and
#  generate your own configs.
#
#  So this is an allowlist, not a denylist. Ignore everything, then
#  re-admit the tool. A denylist over a directory this noisy misses
#  something eventually; this cannot.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*

!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/admin/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Inside admin/: the package, its tests and its docs -- but not its
#  virtualenv, its caches, or the state it writes while running.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Published by the supervisor while the server runs; meaningless once it exits.
admin/.runtime.json

# Published by the Discord listener while it runs; same deal.
admin/.listener.json

# The Discord bot token and channel id. A credential: anyone holding it can
# post as the bot, so it never leaves this machine.
admin/.notify.json

# Log fingerprints and the metrics time series. Both are this server's
# operating history: player names, session times, machine load.
admin/*.db
admin/.*.db
# SQLite's write-ahead log and shared-memory sidecars. Both databases run in
# WAL mode, so these hold rows not yet checkpointed into the .db -- the same
# data, in files the patterns above do not match.
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  This server's own setup, which happens to live under admin/.
#  Useful here, meaningless to anyone else running the tool.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
admin/permissions/
admin/docs/POST-PREGEN.md

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Editors / OS / local scratch
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]
